	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a deo patre per Christum dominum nostrum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tandem tempus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>est, ut ad tam amicam et humanam tuam adhortationem scribamus, <persName ref="p8090">Heinriche</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>candidissime, cum toties non solum obtuleris amicitiam familiaritatemque tuam, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sed et literis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die Briefe, auf die sich <persName ref="p3481">Vogt</persName> bezieht, sind nicht erhalten.</note> nos inhortatus sis, quo mutua scribendi vicissitudine amicitiam nostram <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>firmam satis, ut spero, non tamen tam notam, exacueremus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quo minus autem huc<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>usque ad te scripserimus, facit partim pudor praeposterus forsan (satis enim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>erga quosvis declaras humanitatem tuam) animusque suae sibi infantiae cons<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cius, partim, quod hucusque semper in animo versaverimus, ut quacunque oblata occas<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ione ego et <persName ref="p8090">Lingkius</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p8090">Heinrich Linggi</persName>.</note> te fratresque <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> inviseremus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Iam enim semel <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nos accinxeramus itineri, sed temporis iniuria nos ab incepto coegit desistere, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cum iam aliquantum viae confecissemus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nunc vero se offert occasio tam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>oportuna, ut non possimus (quoniam iter nostrum hucusque praepeditum est), quin ad <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vos scribamus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ea est de re eucharistiae, quam tu prius ansam arripuisti <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tuam erga nos familiaritatem ac amicitiam per literas significandi<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl>, S. 463, 2-5.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Videmus, vir <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>integerrime, ac, proh dolor, magno cum ecclesiarum damno experimur <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quosdam non tam candide in hoc agere negocio.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Videmus item, quod boni <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>exautorantur, minus firmi (quos tamen firmissimos existimassemus) <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nutant<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p3481">Vogt</persName> spielt auf die Ereignisse in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> an; vgl. etwa <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl>, <ref target="file11127">Nr. 1084</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ii, qui pacis evangelium toti mundo offerre debebant, non parva in <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ecclesia dissidia generant aut saltem dissidiorum fomites aliis suppeditant.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Nuper vero senatui nostro oblatum est<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Die nachfolgend erwähnten Dokumente wurden vom <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Rat nach <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhausen</placeName> übermittelt; s. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 933 zu y.</note> rescriptum mentis Lutheranae in ne<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gocio eucharistiae<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Siehe oben <ref target="file11139">Nr. 1096</ref>, Anm. 1.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De quo quid iudicemus, praesertim vero de<pb type="edition" next="48"/> expositione <persName ref="p467">Bu<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cerana</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Gemeint ist das Schreiben <persName ref="p5565">Capitos</persName> und <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> an die reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName>, das zusammen mit dem Schreiben <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> von <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> gesandt worden war (Original: Basel StA, Kirchenakten A 9, 54r.-56v.; gedruckt in: <bibl source="b714">Zwa</bibl> VI/I, 1934, 8-11).</note>, nondum liquet.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Malumus enim, ne aut temerarii aut praefracti <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>videamur, tuum, <persName ref="p8171">Theodori</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanique</persName> ac <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> iudicium audire quam nostram <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>temeritatem ostendere.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Illi expositioni, quam prius obtulistis Lutheranae fact<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ioni<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p3481">Vogt</persName> bezieht sich auf das Schreiben der reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> vom 12. Januar 1537 (<bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> Briefwechsel XII 241-275. Nr. 4268).</note>, tam abest ut repugnemus repugnaverimusve prius, ut toti dudum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>in vestram sententiam pedibus descenderimus<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 2, 7, 12 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 616f).</note>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Neque a nobis stetit, quo minus et n<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>os<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">et nos <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> subscripserimus, sed a senatu nostro<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><placeName ref="l441">Schaffhausen</placeName> hatte die <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Tagung vom 12.-14. November 1536, an der das Schreiben an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> entworfen worden war, nicht besucht (vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 785 b und <bibl source="b42">Vadian BW V</bibl> 470).</note>, qui qualis sit, tuipse nosti, a quo ne<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>que ullo conatu impetrare potuimus, ut et ipse una vobiscum subscriberet.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Sed de his satis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Iam hoc superest, ut pro eruditione, iudicio et candore <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>vestro nos per literas<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Ein Antwortschreiben ist nicht erhalten.</note> certiores faciatis, quid acturi sitis quidve responsuri ad <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> scripta.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Existimamus enim senatum nostrum in hac re forsan nostram <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>exacturum sententiam.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si igitur vobiscum concordes et <foreign xml:lang="el">ὁµόψηϕοι</foreign> reperiamur, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>videbitur non parum emolumenti allaturum ecclesiae nostrae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8090">Lingkius</persName> laborat pleu<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>retico morbo, alioquin ipse sibi sumpsisset scribendi provinciam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Revaliturum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>tamen indies speramus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Si quid certi dignumque cognitu de ecclesia <placeName ref="l41">Bern<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ana</placeName> apud vos constet, rogo, per literas significato.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te sym<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>mystae mei.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta nomine meo fratres, in primis vero <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName ref="p1753">Leonem</persName> <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanumque</persName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaffusiae</placeName>, 7. februarii anno 1538.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/><persName ref="p3481">Simpertus Vogtius</persName>, minister <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l441">Scaffusanae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctrina et pietate insigni viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> [a]<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Das auf das Verschlußband geschriebene a fehlt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>concionibus, amico <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suo singulari.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
